{"ID":"20240515131418-q4j0rw1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131418-q4j0rw1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131418-q4j0rw1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140232-b3y5qre\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515161035-i1qhp7s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:345,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140232-b3y5qre\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:599,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:599\u0026#125;","title":"053","type":"doc","updated":"20240515161041"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140232-b3y5qre","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 893px;","id":"20240515140232-b3y5qre","updated":"20240515161041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/25"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HN"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"57歲，身材中等較瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/22"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1990年乳癌開刀，並作八次化療（化療後即停經），之後服藥（Tomoxifen）五年。到2003年，又再次發現乳癌，並轉移至骨頭產生骨癌。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經倪師及大師姐治療後略有改善，也停服西藥，西醫檢查癌細胞未再增生，但亦未減少。今日持續回診。目前仍有服西藥（Keppra、SAHA）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠尚好，但睡不深，時又無法入眠。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫度上升許多，有時很熱，多數時是熱的，尤其晚上很熱；但身無熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口好，吃很多，味覺好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"環跳仍痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力時好時壞（倪師認為是服SAHA引起）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喜涼飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"午後無身熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"沈稍數、有力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診:\n舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌中間部位苔淡黃濕，兩側較少苔，質紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右瞳孔對光較無反應→右腎陽不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙眼肝區較鬆散、不緊實感→肝區受損。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙內眥色較淡→心陽不足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白睛上有1-2條血絲→師云白睛上見3條血絲以上者會發作癲癇。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人進步許多，陽脈大於陰脈，陰陽協調；但脈仍沈細→裡寒仍有。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同2008/04/25處方，加生附子二錢（另包）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七帖，九碗煮成三碗，早晚餐前各服一碗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-34六兩，早晚餐後各服30粒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.病患有明顯改善，但病症尚未痊癒，且診斷後病因病機仍相同，故效不更方，方義同前。而病患裡寒證有減少，所以將生附子減量。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.因病患抱怨會掉髮，故兼服HT-34補天丸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.同時倪師要求病患停服SAHA。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240515161035-i1qhp7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240515161035-i1qhp7s"}}]}